                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.67/40a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-09T15:00:00-05:00">February 9, 1934—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Senate on February 5 consented ratification treaty of extradition between
                    United States and Turkey, signed at Lausanne, Switzerland, August 6, 1923.
                    Inform Turkish Government. Cable status of treaty in Turkey.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
